# Fedora names for the packages of packages.txt and packages-compositors.txt (the reasons stay there), for GUEST=fedora and
# fedora-compositors. One line per package: the name used there, then the Fedora package(s) that provide it; a name with
# nothing after it has no Fedora counterpart (or is part of the base system) and is dropped; a name not listed here is
# kept as it is (the two distributions agree). packages.sh applies it. Verify a name with `dnf repoquery NAME` in the guest.
